{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27628","headline":"题杭州灵隐寺 · 张祜","name":"题杭州灵隐寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峰峦开一掌，朱槛几环延。\n佛地花分界，僧房竹引泉。\n五更楼下月，十里郭中烟。\n後塔耸亭後，前山横阁前。\n溪沙涵水静，涧石点苔鲜。\n好是呼猨久，西岩深响连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}